      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5224362841208793190\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8EA0.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🎠\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Telegram now supports carousels\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eOne small step for messaging, one giant leap toward turning cat photos into keynote presentations. \u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5373223594484587136\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F98BA.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e😺\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e",
